# Datasets. Never commit these: UTA-RLDD alone is 111 GB.
data/
*/data/raw/
*/data/frames/
*/data/refs/
**/UTA-RLDD/
**/NTHU*/
**/YawDD*/
**/FFHQ*/
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv

# Personal documents. The signed licence agreement contains a home address
# and a signature image, so it stays off any remote.
*LicenseAgreement*.pdf
*LicenceAgreement*.pdf

# Generated outputs
*.parquet
server_report.txt
setup_report.txt
**/results/*.csv
# ...except the results CSVs themselves: small, and the only record of what was run.
!**/results/*.csv
**/charts/*.png
**/*.meta.json
phase3_synthetic_dataset/raw/*
phase3_synthetic_dataset/balanced/*
!**/.gitkeep.md

